1
00:00:04,971 --> 00:00:05,954
糟糕
Oh, no.

2
00:00:06,024 --> 00:00:08,340
又過去一年了嗎
Has it been a year already?

3
00:00:08,340 --> 00:00:09,754
? 你是一面偉大古老的旗幟 ?
♪ You're a grand old flag ♪

4
00:00:09,754 --> 00:00:11,399
? 一面高揚的旗幟 ?
♪ You're a high-flying flag ♪

5
00:00:11,399 --> 00:00:14,567
? 愿你永遠飄揚在和平年代 ?
♪ And forever in peace may you wave ♪

6
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:17,300
我們熱愛國慶節
We love the Fourth of July.

7
00:00:17,380 --> 00:00:18,580
這個節日太完美了
It's the perfect holiday.

8
00:00:18,660 --> 00:00:21,800
你可以在戶外烹飪 放煙花 穿短褲
You get to cook outside, blow stuff up, wear shorts.

9
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:23,880
復活節該好好學學
Easter should be taking notes.

10
00:00:24,060 --> 00:00:26,920
? 好好望著這偉大古老的旗幟 ?
♪ Keep your eyes on the grand old flag ♪

11
00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:29,820
比我記憶中的還漫長
That was longer than I remember.

12
00:00:31,380 --> 00:00:31,900
你好
Hello?

13
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:35,760
喬 你該感恩你生活在這個國家
Joe, you should be thankful that you live in this country.

14
00:00:36,060 --> 00:00:39,140
我的半個童年都在服飾店香蕉共和國度過
I spent half of my childhood in a Banana Republic.

15
00:00:39,640 --> 00:00:42,020
那是我們村里唯一有空調的商店
It was the only store in my village that had air-conditioner.

16
00:00:42,280 --> 00:00:43,240
遵命 主席先生
Yes, Mr. President.

17
00:00:43,760 --> 00:00:46,500
遵命 這是我的榮幸 謝謝您
Yes, sir, I'd be honored to, sir. Thank you.

18
00:00:46,617 --> 00:00:47,640
天大的好消息
Amazing news.

19
00:00:47,640 --> 00:00:50,347
今天游行的大禮官爆出性侵丑聞了
The grand marshal for today's parade just got #MeToo'd,

20
00:00:50,520 --> 00:00:51,980
他們叫我去接任
and they need me to fill in.

21
00:00:52,333 --> 00:00:54,569
杰 我真替你高興
Oh, Jay, I'm so happy for you!

22
00:00:54,569 --> 00:00:56,866
現在你遺愿清單上沒實現的
So, now the only thing left on your bucket list

23
00:00:57,160 --> 00:00:59,180
只有赤手空拳大戰俄國佬了
is to bare-knuckle fight a Russian!

24
00:00:59,840 --> 00:01:02,820
曼尼的公路大旅行就快結束了
Oh, and Manny's gonna be back home

25
00:01:02,820 --> 00:01:05,520
他能及時趕回家看游行
from his big road trip just in time for the parade.

26
00:01:05,831 --> 00:01:08,729
他走了這么久 我等不及見他了
He's been gone for so long. I can't wait to see him.

27
00:01:08,729 --> 00:01:09,330
太好了
That's great!

28
00:01:09,330 --> 00:01:10,945
到時全家人都能齊聚 和我一起
We'll have the whole family back together with me

29
00:01:10,945 --> 00:01:13,241
乘男爵敞篷車
to ride in the convertible LeBaron.

30
00:01:13,420 --> 00:01:14,660
喬 你的游行揮手練得如何了
Joe, how's your parade wave?

31
00:01:15,600 --> 00:01:16,560
我們再努力改進
We'll work on it.

32
00:01:16,661 --> 00:01:18,326
? 在紅白藍的旗幟下 ?
♪ Every heart beats true ♪

33
00:01:18,326 --> 00:01:20,000
? 每顆心臟都真摯地跳動著 ?
♪ For the red, white, and blue ♪

34
00:01:20,080 --> 00:01:21,120
? 將永遠沒有... ?
♪ Where there's never a... ♪

35
00:01:35,620 --> 00:01:36,140
還要
More!

36
00:01:38,520 --> 00:01:40,740
行 我有時間幫你
Yeah. I've got time to help you.

37
00:01:40,969 --> 00:01:44,499
看你表姐人多好 幫朋友的忙
Oh, look at your cousin being so sweet and helping out a friend.

38
00:01:45,160 --> 00:01:46,600
你這個軟弱的小懦夫
Such a weak little coward.

39
00:01:46,860 --> 00:01:47,900
還沒搞定嗎
Are we done yet?

40
00:01:48,200 --> 00:01:50,100
沒有 這座橋真的很大
No. It's a really big bridge.

41
00:01:50,260 --> 00:01:52,460
或許是你這個人真的很渺小
Or maybe you're just a really tiny man.

42
00:01:53,484 --> 00:01:55,540
我的橫跨美國公路旅行很順利
Things were going great on my cross-country drive

43
00:01:55,540 --> 00:01:57,154
直到我突然患上了
until I fell behind schedule

44
00:01:57,154 --> 00:02:00,313
完全合理 基于事實的過橋恐懼癥
after I developed a perfectly rational, fact-based fear

45
00:02:00,380 --> 00:02:01,340
進度就耽誤了
of driving over bridges.

46
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:03,500
我打電話找小卡幫忙
I called Cam for support

47
00:02:03,500 --> 00:02:04,580
因為他做過駕駛教練
since he taught driver's ed,

48
00:02:04,600 --> 00:02:05,460
但他不在
but he wasn't around.

49
00:02:06,040 --> 00:02:06,460
干嘛啦
What?

50
00:02:07,060 --> 00:02:08,600
原來嚴厲的言語痛斥
Turns out a strong verbal lashing

51
00:02:08,600 --> 00:02:10,880
正好能激勵我過那座橋
was exactly what I needed to get me across that bridge

52
00:02:10,880 --> 00:02:13,280
還有像癌癥一樣遍布全國的所有橋
and the many others that cover this country like a cancer.

53
00:02:14,172 --> 00:02:17,230
好了 卡爾 來和媽媽打個招呼
Okay, Cal. Let's say hi to Mommy.

54
00:02:17,230 --> 00:02:18,253
說"媽媽 你好"
Say, "Hi, Mommy!"

55
00:02:18,253 --> 00:02:20,590
要是我入鏡了 后退一點再把燈關上
If I'm in that shot, back up a-and turn the lights down.

56
00:02:20,640 --> 00:02:22,900
咱昨晚吃的是中餐 我人都水腫了
We had Chinese food last night. I look like a blowfish.

57
00:02:23,066 --> 00:02:24,741
知道嗎 米奇爾 你不是重點
Okay, you know what, Mitchell? It's not about you.

58
00:02:24,800 --> 00:02:27,260
我向我姐保證過 會在她過生日時
I promised we would send a video of Cal

59
00:02:27,260 --> 00:02:29,500
給她發卡爾的視頻
to my sister for her birthday,

60
00:02:29,520 --> 00:02:32,040
已經過去一周了 我們必須把視頻拍好
and that was a week ago, so we got to get it done.

61
00:02:32,600 --> 00:02:33,760
我們一直在照看
We have been watching

62
00:02:33,760 --> 00:02:36,200
個頭看起來比年齡大的外甥卡爾
my big-for-his-age nephew Cal

63
00:02:36,273 --> 00:02:37,768
我姐姐帕梅隆
while my sister Pameron is --

64
00:02:37,768 --> 00:02:39,833
回密蘇里去償還一些債務
is back in Missouri paying off a little debt.

65
00:02:39,833 --> 00:02:41,257
還社會的債 她進監獄了
To society. She's in prison.

66
00:02:41,257 --> 00:02:42,631
因為稍微違反了假釋條例
For a tiny parole violation.

67
00:02:42,631 --> 00:02:43,965
她在某間商店試穿商品
She tried something on in a store

68
00:02:43,965 --> 00:02:45,178
不小心就那么走出了商店
and accidentally walked out.

69
00:02:45,178 --> 00:02:46,713
她帶走的是另一個女人的包
It was another woman's purse.

70
00:02:46,713 --> 00:02:48,237
不幸中的一線希望是
The silver lining is,

71
00:02:48,240 --> 00:02:51,460
卡爾因為我們的育兒經驗十分受益
Cal is benefiting from our parenting experience.

72
00:02:51,500 --> 00:02:53,840
米奇爾在讓卡爾的小腦袋瓜成型
Mitchell is molding young Cal's brain

73
00:02:53,840 --> 00:02:55,780
我則負責撫弄孩子的身體
while I handle the young boy's body.

74
00:02:56,480 --> 00:02:58,200
我們沒坐牢真是奇跡
It's a miracle we're not in prison.

75
00:02:58,580 --> 00:02:58,820
是啊
Yeah.

76
00:02:59,258 --> 00:03:02,116
好 我們為媽媽唱字母歌吧
Okay, let's sing the alphabet for Mommy.

77
00:03:02,116 --> 00:03:03,560
快來 我們練過的
Come on, you and I worked on this.

78
00:03:03,560 --> 00:03:04,853
A B
A B.

79
00:03:05,040 --> 00:03:05,460
6
Six.

80
00:03:06,120 --> 00:03:08,220
我想是我傳授的信息太多了
You know, I think I put so much information in there,

81
00:03:08,220 --> 00:03:09,880
他說話時就搞混了
it's getting jumbled up on the way out.

82
00:03:09,998 --> 00:03:11,482
我們拍點你教的東西
Well, let's-let's do some of your stuff.

83
00:03:11,482 --> 00:03:12,475
丟個球給他接之類的
Throw him a ball or something.

84
00:03:12,475 --> 00:03:14,520
好 這主意好
Oh, okay, yeah. That's a great idea.

85
00:03:14,520 --> 00:03:16,436
好了 我數到三 卡爾
Okay, on the count of 3, Cal.

86
00:03:16,436 --> 00:03:18,346
準備好了嗎 1 2 3
Are you ready? 1, 2, 3!

87
00:03:18,367 --> 00:03:20,246
好吧
Oh. Okay.

88
00:03:20,357 --> 00:03:21,861
那好吧 擁抱
All right, um... well, hugs!

89
00:03:21,861 --> 00:03:23,185
來擁抱一下好嗎
Hey, how about a hug?

90
00:03:24,740 --> 00:03:25,920
他真擅長擁抱
He is such a good hugger.

91
00:03:26,700 --> 00:03:27,420
好吧 是這樣的
Okay, here's the thing --

92
00:03:27,540 --> 00:03:29,080
卡爾來咱家時橄欖球集訓營開始了
football camp started when Cal came.

93
00:03:29,340 --> 00:03:30,440
之后我因為
Then I was laid up

94
00:03:30,555 --> 00:03:32,551
那頓螃蟹大餐臥床不起
because of that dinner at Absolutely Crabulous.

95
00:03:32,551 --> 00:03:35,328
別擔心 我這邊做得也不好
Well, don't worry. I've been slacking on my end, too.

96
00:03:35,328 --> 00:03:36,421
是的 可我一直對小帕說
Yeah, but I've been telling Pam

97
00:03:36,421 --> 00:03:37,865
卡爾在這成長得特別好
that Cal is thriving here.

98
00:03:37,865 --> 00:03:40,964
我們不能把他背AB6的視頻發過去
We can't send her a video of him reciting his AB6s!

99
00:03:41,920 --> 00:03:42,800
我在想
I wonder...

100
00:03:42,800 --> 00:03:43,840
接著說 我入伙
Go on. I'm in.

101
00:03:44,060 --> 00:03:46,000
有沒有可能用拍攝技巧
Is it possible to shoot him in a way

102
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:47,940
讓他看起來比實際做得好
that makes him look better than he is?

103
00:03:48,174 --> 00:03:49,899
這還用問嗎 范·迪塞爾都能當影星
Oh, honey, are you kidding? Vin Diesel's a movie star.

104
00:03:49,899 --> 00:03:51,654
剪輯能使一切成為可能
Anything's possible with editing.

105
00:03:53,820 --> 00:03:55,380
你拿的是什么
What do you got there?

106
00:03:55,620 --> 00:03:57,480
我只是在選大學課程
Oh, just choosing some classes for college.

107
00:03:58,200 --> 00:03:59,340
這個看起來挺有趣的
This one looks interesting.

108
00:03:59,867 --> 00:04:01,461
"本加強課程..."
"In this intensive" --

109
00:04:01,461 --> 00:04:02,335
算了
Nope.

110
00:04:03,260 --> 00:04:04,220
快放下
Drop that!

111
00:04:05,440 --> 00:04:06,780
今天是比賽日 伙計
Game day, buddy.

112
00:04:07,220 --> 00:04:08,900
有史以來第一次 盧克和我
For the first time ever, Luke and I

113
00:04:08,900 --> 00:04:10,760
要參加體育項目之王
are taking part in the sport of kings,

114
00:04:11,040 --> 00:04:11,900
最美味的科學
the savory science.

115
00:04:12,520 --> 00:04:14,780
我們組隊參加了親子熱狗大胃王比賽
We're teamed in a parent/child hot-dog-eating contest.

116
00:04:15,200 --> 00:04:17,140
我們已經訓練了幾周 我非常驕傲地說
We've been training for weeks, and I'm proud to say that Luke,

117
00:04:17,180 --> 00:04:19,940
盧克和他爹一樣 天生一張吃熱狗的嘴
like his old man, is blessed with a dogger's mouth.

118
00:04:20,720 --> 00:04:22,140
我覺得肚子里某個地方裂開了
I felt something tear inside.

119
00:04:22,140 --> 00:04:23,440
挺過去
Push through it.

120
00:04:23,600 --> 00:04:25,800
撐到爽以后你會感謝我的
You'll thank me when you start to feel the gorger's high.

121
00:04:31,700 --> 00:04:32,400
搞什么
What the hell?!

122
00:04:32,460 --> 00:04:34,280
熱狗讓你生氣了嗎
Oh, is the hot dog making you angry?

123
00:04:34,360 --> 00:04:36,380
人生氣時胃會變大12%
An angry stomach is 12% larger.

124
00:04:37,020 --> 00:04:38,720
我覺得我們有很大機會
I think we've got a real shot

125
00:04:38,966 --> 00:04:41,042
能戰勝朗達和譚蒂·霍達克家
to take down Rhonda and Thandie Hodak.

126
00:04:41,042 --> 00:04:42,245
可她們從沒輸過
But they're undefeated.

127
00:04:42,245 --> 00:04:44,802
看來我們是"落水熱狗"
I guess that makes us "Under-dogs."

128
00:04:45,033 --> 00:04:46,778
你這個哏憋了多久了
How long you been sitting on that one?

129
00:04:46,778 --> 00:04:49,245
沒你在那個沙發上坐得久
Not as long as you've been sitting on that couch.

130
00:04:49,806 --> 00:04:51,672
你地上撿的百吉餅分我一半好嗎
Hey, hey. Can I get in on that floor bagel?

131
00:04:51,672 --> 00:04:54,921
艾麗克斯今年暑假開始時決定放松一下
Alex decided to take off some time earlier this summer,

132
00:04:54,921 --> 00:04:56,886
就像她做的所有事一樣
and, like everything else she does,

133
00:04:56,896 --> 00:04:58,581
她有點擅長過頭了
she did it a little too well.

134
00:04:59,440 --> 00:05:00,180
是誰
Who's there?

135
00:05:00,560 --> 00:05:01,360
你拿吃的來了嗎
Did you bring food?

136
00:05:02,540 --> 00:05:03,500
番茄
Uh...tomatoes.

137
00:05:03,640 --> 00:05:05,080
不過還要六周才能吃
But they won't be ready for six weeks.

138
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:06,880
你居然還有備用的
You have a backup?

139
00:05:07,200 --> 00:05:08,900
我壓在手機上睡著了
Well, I fell asleep on my phone,

140
00:05:08,900 --> 00:05:10,480
好像是我的臉又訂購了一件
and I think my face ordered another one.

141
00:05:12,650 --> 00:05:14,536
你想和我一起放松嗎
You know, do you want to join me?

142
00:05:14,536 --> 00:05:15,990
幾周后你就要回去工作了
You go back to work in a few weeks.

143
00:05:15,990 --> 00:05:17,745
不放松一下你會后悔的
You'll regret it if you don't relax a little.

144
00:05:17,745 --> 00:05:19,760
好吧 當然好
Uh, okay. Sure.

145
00:05:19,760 --> 00:05:24,754
這個等十分鐘再種到地里也行 對嗎
The-this can wait 10 minutes until I get him into the ground, right?

146
00:05:26,740 --> 00:05:28,825
幫我撓撓鼻子好嗎 我覺得你的手更近
Can you scratch my nose? I feel like you're closer.

147
00:05:28,825 --> 00:05:31,934
躺桌子上做肚子按摩
Okay, up on the table for a little stomach massage

148
00:05:31,934 --> 00:05:33,348
和面對喝倒彩的心理準備
and heckler prep.

149
00:05:33,348 --> 00:05:35,514
美女們 我和阿爾文最近不太順利
Hey, gals, things haven't been going that great

150
00:05:35,514 --> 00:05:37,480
他等會來道別完
between me and Arvin, and he's stopping by

151
00:05:37,480 --> 00:05:39,555
就要去瑞士了
to say goodbye before leaving for Switzerland.

152
00:05:39,555 --> 00:05:40,709
你們能不能脫掉一件式連身睡衣
Could you take off the onesies

153
00:05:40,709 --> 00:05:43,216
別搞得像我們住在瘋人院一樣
and make it look like we don't live in an insane asylum?

154
00:05:43,216 --> 00:05:46,114
你弱爆了 你吃相真蠢
You suck! You eat like a moron!

155
00:05:46,114 --> 00:05:46,916
老天啊
Oh, my God!

156
00:05:46,916 --> 00:05:48,420
你們簡直是要逼阿爾文
It's like you want Arvin

157
00:05:48,420 --> 00:05:51,559
把回程機票從一座阿爾卑丟下來
to throw his return ticket off an Alp!

158
00:05:51,559 --> 00:05:53,133
難怪她情緒這么緊繃
Mm. No wonder she's so stressed.

159
00:05:53,133 --> 00:05:55,350
她穿了大概有7件式吧
She's wearing, like, a seven-sie.

160
00:05:58,120 --> 00:06:00,420
海莉 在這遇見你好巧啊
Haley. Fancy meeting you here.

161
00:06:01,216 --> 00:06:03,041
為什么 我住在這兒啊
Wait, why? I-I live here.

162
00:06:03,282 --> 00:06:05,809
我知道 我只是想幽默一把
No, I-I know. I was -- I was making a joke.

163
00:06:05,809 --> 00:06:06,962
好傻
It was stupid.

164
00:06:06,962 --> 00:06:09,018
不傻 很好笑
Oh, no, it -- it wasn't stupid. It was funny.

165
00:06:09,148 --> 00:06:10,402
但你沒笑
Well, you didn't laugh.

166
00:06:10,402 --> 00:06:12,267
再說一遍 這次我會笑的
Well, do it again. I'll laugh this time.

167
00:06:12,678 --> 00:06:13,792
還是算了吧
I'd rather not.

168
00:06:14,062 --> 00:06:16,429
對不起 我只是有點
Sorry. I'm just, um, a little --

169
00:06:16,429 --> 00:06:19,136
我很緊張 我覺得這次分別
I'm really nervous, and I feel like this goodbye

170
00:06:19,136 --> 00:06:20,319
壓力很大
has so much pressure on it.

171
00:06:20,319 --> 00:06:23,548
我們就放輕松 好好相處吧
So let's just relax and be with each other.

172
00:06:23,560 --> 00:06:25,120
其實我現在就得走了
I actually have to go.

173
00:06:26,040 --> 00:06:27,080
我是說真的
No, seriously.

174
00:06:27,700 --> 00:06:29,400
我看錯行程表了
I misread my itinerary,

175
00:06:29,400 --> 00:06:31,080
現在就得趕去機場
and I have to get to the airport.

176
00:06:32,062 --> 00:06:34,088
不要啊 就這樣了嗎
No! So, uh, this is it?

177
00:06:34,088 --> 00:06:35,372
這就是道別了
This is goodbye?

178
00:06:35,582 --> 00:06:36,896
恐怕是的
I'm afraid so.

179
00:06:37,367 --> 00:06:38,520
我會想你的
I'm gonna miss you.

180
00:06:38,520 --> 00:06:39,765
我也會想你的
I'll miss you, too.

181
00:06:41,388 --> 00:06:43,715
那是我的車 我該...
That's my car. I should probably --

182
00:06:44,567 --> 00:06:48,007
好吧 再見了 海莉
Okay. Uh, well... goodbye, Haley.

183
00:06:51,900 --> 00:06:52,500
愛你哦
Love you.

184
00:06:54,300 --> 00:06:55,480
我也愛你
Love you, too.

185
00:06:59,120 --> 00:07:00,200
他走了嗎
Is he gone?

186
00:07:01,360 --> 00:07:02,680
-對 -太好了
- Yeah? - Oh, good.

187
00:07:03,080 --> 00:07:04,920
沒人想被話嘮老爹
No one wants old fuddy-duddy dad

188
00:07:04,920 --> 00:07:06,380
毀掉浪漫時刻
ruining the big romantic moment.

189
00:07:06,460 --> 00:07:07,860
我去樓上躲進盧克的衣柜里
I'll be upstairs hiding in Luke's closet.

190
00:07:11,422 --> 00:07:14,370
好了 來 卡爾 嚼花生醬
All right. There we go, Cal. Chew the peanut butter.

191
00:07:14,370 --> 00:07:15,644
看見沒 現在經過剪輯后
See? Now, with editing,

192
00:07:15,644 --> 00:07:17,429
我們想讓他看起來在說什么都行
we can make it look like he's saying anything we want --

193
00:07:17,429 --> 00:07:19,846
數字 字母表 開猶太人玩笑
numbers, the alphabet, a joke about Jewish people.

194
00:07:19,846 --> 00:07:20,949
小帕可喜歡了
Pam loves those.

195
00:07:20,949 --> 00:07:22,333
電影拍攝技巧對我不是難事
Movie tricks come easy to me --

196
00:07:22,333 --> 00:07:24,860
畢竟小丑就是很會騙人的
you know, clowns being naturals at deception.

197
00:07:24,860 --> 00:07:27,206
沒錯 我們當初約會了幾個月后
It's true -- a couple months into dating,

198
00:07:27,206 --> 00:07:28,720
小卡告訴我他是一名小丑
Cam told me he was a clown,

199
00:07:28,720 --> 00:07:30,265
還表演給我看
did a little performance for me,

200
00:07:30,265 --> 00:07:32,641
而我的確感到上當受騙了
and I -- I did feel deceived.

201
00:07:33,414 --> 00:07:35,660
好了 我說"開拍"時
Okay, now, when I say "Action,"

202
00:07:35,660 --> 00:07:37,335
卡爾就把球丟給我
Cal's gonna throw me the ball.

203
00:07:37,335 --> 00:07:38,518
你就倒著走
You're gonna walk backwards,

204
00:07:38,518 --> 00:07:40,082
然后我重新剪輯 倒放
and then in editing, I'll reverse it

205
00:07:40,082 --> 00:07:41,606
看起來就會像卡爾接住了球
to make it look like Cal's catching the ball

206
00:07:42,300 --> 00:07:43,280
而你在正常往前走
and you're walking normally.

207
00:07:43,480 --> 00:07:45,020
為什么要把我拍進去
Why am I even in it at all?

208
00:07:45,280 --> 00:07:47,300
米奇爾 提醒我一下 最偉大的藝術作品
Remind me of something, Mitchell -- is the best art made

209
00:07:47,300 --> 00:07:50,320
是很多人七嘴八舌還是一個人獨立創作出來的
by a million voices chiming in or one man with a single vision?

210
00:07:51,243 --> 00:07:53,881
等會再剪輯琴音進去
Okay, and we'll lay in the piano later.

211
00:07:54,442 --> 00:07:58,604
? 一閃一閃亮晶晶 ?
♪ Twinkle, twinkle, little star ♪

212
00:07:58,604 --> 00:08:02,736
? 滿天都是小星星 ?
♪ How I wonder what you are ♪

213
00:08:02,736 --> 00:08:04,280
-我要尿尿 -他要尿尿
- I have to pee! - He has to pee.

214
00:08:04,840 --> 00:08:06,040
-好 他要尿尿 -對
- Okay, he has to pee. - Yep.

215
00:08:06,520 --> 00:08:07,620
休息五分鐘
All right. Take five!

216
00:08:08,740 --> 00:08:10,240
莉莉 這是初剪
Lily, this is our first cut,

217
00:08:10,240 --> 00:08:12,640
如果發現穿幫畫面就告訴我們
so if you see anything wonky, let us know.

218
00:08:16,220 --> 00:08:17,600
媽咪你好呀
Oh. Hello, Mommy.

219
00:08:17,920 --> 00:08:18,840
生日快樂
Happy birthday.

220
00:08:18,841 --> 00:08:21,759
一加一等于二
1 plus 1 is 2.

221
00:08:22,440 --> 00:08:23,480
很簡單的數學題
Simple math.

222
00:08:24,460 --> 00:08:25,760
我能接住球
I can catch a ball.

223
00:08:29,039 --> 00:08:30,202
你怎么沒看到貓經過
How'd you miss the cat?

224
00:08:30,720 --> 00:08:32,720
我看見了 那條剪輯是你最自然的一次了
I didn't. That take was your best walk.

225
00:08:38,340 --> 00:08:40,360
這畫面太贊了
That is gold.

226
00:08:46,809 --> 00:08:48,584
為什么旁邊要放這么大的酒瓶
Why the giant bottle of wine?

227
00:08:49,060 --> 00:08:49,920
這樣顯得腳小
It's for perspective,

228
00:08:50,060 --> 00:08:51,620
沒人會問這個問題
and nobody's asking that question.

229
00:08:51,780 --> 00:08:52,740
我剛不是問了嗎
Didn't I just ask it?

230
00:08:53,100 --> 00:08:53,660
小卡
Cam.

231
00:08:53,900 --> 00:08:55,720
我知道 已被權威認證爛透了
Yeah, I know. It's certified rotten.

232
00:09:02,440 --> 00:09:03,000
盧克
Luke.

233
00:09:03,726 --> 00:09:05,561
他第一口只咬進1/3根香腸
He's only getting 1/3 of the dog on his first bite.

234
00:09:05,561 --> 00:09:07,717
至少得咬半根 否則就跟冠軍無緣了
Anything less than half, and you're playing for second.

235
00:09:08,080 --> 00:09:11,180
好消息是離國慶節還有幾周呢
Well, the good news is, the Fourth is weeks away.

236
00:09:12,871 --> 00:09:15,348
今天就是國慶
It's -- it's today.

237
00:09:15,348 --> 00:09:16,252
今天
Toda--

238
00:09:17,540 --> 00:09:17,980
六月呢
June...?

239
00:09:18,120 --> 00:09:18,800
已經過了
Yeah -- gone.

240
00:09:18,928 --> 00:09:23,361
你在這兒呢 我們的節目快開始了
There you are! It's almost time for our show.

241
00:09:23,361 --> 00:09:24,775
等等 你穿的是什么
Wait -- what are you wearing?

242
00:09:24,775 --> 00:09:25,597
衣服
Clothes?

243
00:09:25,597 --> 00:09:26,861
我得重拾上學狀態
I got to get back into school mode

244
00:09:27,260 --> 00:09:28,340
不然我的犀利就沒了
before I lose my edge.

245
00:09:29,020 --> 00:09:30,620
媽媽 你最好考慮一下重返人間
Mom, you might want to think about rejoining life

246
00:09:30,620 --> 00:09:32,060
不然你的腦子也要廢了
before your brain freezes, too.

247
00:09:32,060 --> 00:09:34,640
你才不用擔心...
Yeah, don't you worry about...

248
00:09:34,640 --> 00:09:35,500
我
Me.

249
00:09:37,980 --> 00:09:38,700
那是什么聲音
What's that?

250
00:09:41,180 --> 00:09:41,580
聽我說
Listen.

251
00:09:43,580 --> 00:09:45,740
沒有一個父親想和兒子談論這個話題
No dad wants to have this talk with his son, but...

252
00:09:45,740 --> 00:09:48,120
但你吃的熱狗不夠多
you're just not eating enough hot dogs.

253
00:09:48,800 --> 00:09:49,560
抱歉
I'm sorry.

254
00:09:50,240 --> 00:09:52,400
不知為什么 我就是沒法集中精神
For some reason, I just -- I can't focus.

255
00:09:53,340 --> 00:09:55,640
我想盧克想說的是
I think what Luke is trying to say is,

256
00:09:55,640 --> 00:09:56,960
他早過了參加這種比賽的年紀
he's too old for this contest

257
00:09:56,960 --> 00:09:58,480
但他不忍心告訴你
and he doesn't have the heart to tell you.

258
00:09:58,700 --> 00:10:00,960
不可能 我是大人了 我還是對比賽充滿激情
That's impossible. I'm an adult. I'm still super into it.

259
00:10:01,036 --> 00:10:04,516
是啊 二十幾歲應該是我吃熱狗的鼎盛時期
Yeah. My 20s should be my prime hot-dog-eating years.

260
00:10:04,800 --> 00:10:06,680
剛才是我第一個猜測
That was just my first attempt.

261
00:10:06,700 --> 00:10:08,320
我會想明白的 等等
I'm gonna figure this out. Hang on.

262
00:10:08,860 --> 00:10:12,000
不管艾麗克斯怎么說 我還是一如既往地犀利
Despite what Alex says, I have not lost my edge.

263
00:10:12,280 --> 00:10:13,400
感覺有怪啊
Something just clicked.

264
00:10:14,320 --> 00:10:16,700
好吧 你說得對 是大學的事
Fine. You're right -- it's college.

265
00:10:16,780 --> 00:10:18,134
-真的嗎 -對
- It is? - Yeah.

266
00:10:18,134 --> 00:10:19,708
我分心是因為我壓力很大
I'm distracted because I'm feeling some pressure

267
00:10:19,900 --> 00:10:21,100
不知道該選哪門課
on which classes to take.

268
00:10:21,380 --> 00:10:23,360
不過別擔心 我會想好的
But don't worry. I'm gonna figure it out.

269
00:10:25,420 --> 00:10:27,520
你怎么看出來的
Wow. How could you tell?

270
00:10:28,683 --> 00:10:31,070
我只是 觀察力很敏銳
I'm just a... perceptive guy.

271
00:10:31,480 --> 00:10:33,460
我當時不是在說盧克 是我下巴發出怪響了
I wasn't talking about Luke. The clicking was in my jaw.

272
00:10:33,580 --> 00:10:35,880
由于密集訓練 我顳下頜關節的舊傷復發
My old TMJ injury was back, thanks to all the training.

273
00:10:36,325 --> 00:10:38,400
這個傷是我念大學時 和室友打賭
I got it in college when I bet my roommate

274
00:10:38,680 --> 00:10:40,780
我比他的金毛獵犬接飛盤還厲害而得來的
I could out-Frisbee-catch his golden retriever.

275
00:10:41,319 --> 00:10:42,913
猜猜誰贏...
And guess who wo-- Aah!

276
00:10:46,460 --> 00:10:48,080
阿爾文和我的告別糟透了
Arvin and I had the worst goodbye.

277
00:10:48,709 --> 00:10:50,735
過去幾個月好怪
Aww. It's been such a weird past couple months.

278
00:10:50,880 --> 00:10:51,820
這么久了嗎
That long?

279
00:10:52,080 --> 00:10:54,000
好像是從在醫院
It feels like it all started in the hospital,

280
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:55,220
我告訴他我愛他之后開始的
after I told him I loved him.

281
00:10:55,320 --> 00:10:56,180
找到原因了
There you go.

282
00:10:56,400 --> 00:10:58,260
就是這個 你給他壓力了
That's it. You pressured him.

283
00:10:58,260 --> 00:11:00,060
-太投入 太快了 -或許吧
- Too much, too soon. - Maybe.

284
00:11:00,360 --> 00:11:01,680
好像有哪里對不上啊
Something's not lining up.

285
00:11:02,460 --> 00:11:03,580
好吧 你說得對
Okay, you're right.

286
00:11:03,860 --> 00:11:04,460
又被你看透啦
Seriously?!

287
00:11:05,120 --> 00:11:06,340
阿爾文不在病房時
Something happened in the hospital

288
00:11:06,340 --> 00:11:07,640
發生了一件事
while Arvin was gone.

289
00:11:09,880 --> 00:11:10,960
又迷路了
Lost again?

290
00:11:11,180 --> 00:11:12,920
不 這次我是特意回來的
No. This time, I meant to come back.

291
00:11:13,540 --> 00:11:15,140
我有一件大事想告訴你
I have some pretty big news.

292
00:11:15,440 --> 00:11:17,240
你最好是坐著聽
You should probably be sitting for this.

293
00:11:17,750 --> 00:11:18,945
好吧
O...kay.

294
00:11:25,300 --> 00:11:26,260
我說謊了
I lied.

295
00:11:26,260 --> 00:11:27,980
我已經離婚了
I'm not married anymore.

296
00:11:28,560 --> 00:11:30,340
我妻子跑回她前夫的身邊了
My wife left me for her ex-husband.

297
00:11:30,566 --> 00:11:32,011
我現在是離婚之人
I'm a divorce.

298
00:11:32,760 --> 00:11:34,140
你為什么要告訴我這個
Why are you telling me this?

299
00:11:34,180 --> 00:11:37,100
因為我搬回來這里了 我要上護理學校
Because I'm back in town, I'm going to nursing school,

300
00:11:37,100 --> 00:11:38,820
我們可能會在路上碰到
and we might run into each other.

301
00:11:39,160 --> 00:11:40,680
我不想接下來這一輩子
I don't want to spend the rest of my life

302
00:11:40,680 --> 00:11:42,340
都在假裝我妻子剛好去廁所了
pretending my wife is in the bathroom.

303
00:11:42,640 --> 00:11:44,820
的確 幾次之后我就會開始擔心她有膀胱問題了
Yeah, I would start to worry about her after a while.

304
00:11:45,740 --> 00:11:47,180
很遺憾你的婚姻沒能走下去
Well, I'm sorry it didn't work out.

305
00:11:47,880 --> 00:11:50,780
沒事 我也一直覺得我跟她沒心靈相通過
It's okay. I don't think we ever really got each other.

306
00:11:51,060 --> 00:11:53,480
比如你還記得我們以前一起去看演唱會時
Like, you know how when you and I used to go to concerts,

307
00:11:53,480 --> 00:11:55,780
我們有過就這么看著彼此就知道...
we used to just look at each other and know...

308
00:11:55,780 --> 00:11:57,580
是讓我坐到你肩膀上
It was time for me to get on your shoulders

309
00:11:57,580 --> 00:11:58,800
我把胸罩丟給鼓手的時刻到了
and throw my bra at the drummer.

310
00:11:59,160 --> 00:11:59,680
是啊
Yeah.

311
00:11:59,740 --> 00:12:01,800
你跟阿爾文也有這樣的默契對吧
Like, you probably have that with Arvin, right?

312
00:12:01,880 --> 00:12:03,300
-絕對的 -那太棒了
- Definitely. - That's awesome.

313
00:12:03,400 --> 00:12:04,340
至于我的妻子呢
With my wife,

314
00:12:04,340 --> 00:12:07,700
她漂亮又聰明 還是個醫生
she's pretty and smart and a doctor.

315
00:12:08,100 --> 00:12:10,140
但如果你總是在告訴自己
But if you're always telling yourself

316
00:12:10,140 --> 00:12:11,040
找到對方真是撞大運了
how lucky you are,

317
00:12:11,040 --> 00:12:13,500
那很可能是因為你害怕捫心自問
it's probably because you're afraid to ask yourself

318
00:12:13,500 --> 00:12:14,740
自己到底開不開心
how happy you are.

319
00:12:14,960 --> 00:12:15,520
對吧
Right?

320
00:12:16,460 --> 00:12:17,980
我給你拿碎冰塊過來啦
I brought ice chips.

321
00:12:18,380 --> 00:12:20,960
還是你們美國叫碎冰薯條呢
Or are they ice fries here?

322
00:12:23,213 --> 00:12:24,247
呵
Ha.

323
00:12:25,400 --> 00:12:27,620
我真不敢相信被迪蘭亂了心
I can't believe Dylan got into my head.

324
00:12:27,880 --> 00:12:29,700
我不敢相信他居然能考進護理學校
I can't believe he got into nursing school.

325
00:12:33,120 --> 00:12:34,420
它們最大把就只有這么大嗎
That's the biggest one they got?

326
00:12:34,640 --> 00:12:36,480
是的 我也不想再回去一趟了
Yes, and I'm not going back again.

327
00:12:37,120 --> 00:12:39,280
你有看到曼尼嗎 我在到處找他呢
Have you seen Manny? I've been looking all over for him.

328
00:12:39,280 --> 00:12:40,080
都沒找到他
I don't see him.

329
00:12:40,120 --> 00:12:42,320
我一直在這忙著巡視軍樂隊
I've been here, busy inspecting the troops.

330
00:12:43,120 --> 00:12:44,520
女孩 你能把帽子戴好嗎
Young lady, could you straighten that hat?

331
00:12:44,944 --> 00:12:47,421
先生 你的號可以去擦亮點
Sir, that -- that horn could use a shine.

332
00:12:47,421 --> 00:12:48,404
去剪頭發
Haircut.

333
00:12:48,404 --> 00:12:50,349
歌洛莉亞 如果今天順利 幾個月之后
Gloria, if this goes well, in a couple of months,

334
00:12:50,349 --> 00:12:52,164
本地的圣誕樹就會由我負責點亮啦
I'll be lighting the town Christmas tree.

335
00:12:52,164 --> 00:12:53,297
認輸吧 老爸
Take that, Dad!

336
00:12:53,297 --> 00:12:54,320
你知道哪里很奇怪嗎
You know what is weird?

337
00:12:54,320 --> 00:12:56,928
去過我們南美那么多年的狂歡節
After so many years at Carnivale,

338
00:12:56,928 --> 00:12:59,735
你們這里的人衣服穿那么嚴實 太怪了
to be at a parade with people fully dressed.

339
00:12:59,735 --> 00:13:01,260
歌洛莉亞 集中點
Gloria, focus.

340
00:13:01,260 --> 00:13:02,654
你的職責很重大呢
You've got a big role in this.

341
00:13:02,654 --> 00:13:03,456
當我剪斷緞帶后
After I cut the ribbon,

342
00:13:03,456 --> 00:13:05,662
你得負責發射大炮
it's your job to fire off the cannon.

343
00:13:05,662 --> 00:13:07,938
那是讓大家開始游行的信號
That's the signal for everybody to start marching.

344
00:13:07,938 --> 00:13:11,167
但難道不是由游行大禮官來發射大炮嗎
But isn't the grand marshal's job to fire the cannon?

345
00:13:11,167 --> 00:13:12,391
這緞帶會自己剪斷自己嗎
So the ribbon cuts itself?

346
00:13:12,391 --> 00:13:14,386
歌洛莉亞 你不懂游行的地方是...
Gloria, what you don't know about parades...

347
00:13:14,386 --> 00:13:15,280
等等 稍等
Wait, wait.

348
00:13:15,780 --> 00:13:16,860
寶貝
Papi! Hello.

349
00:13:17,740 --> 00:13:20,040
你還來嗎 游行都要開始了
Are you coming? The parade is about to start.

350
00:13:20,363 --> 00:13:22,208
杰
Hey! Jay!

351
00:13:22,349 --> 00:13:23,953
湯姆 你好嗎
Hey, Tom! How's it going?

352
00:13:23,953 --> 00:13:24,725
其實最近很好呢
Great, actually.

353
00:13:24,725 --> 00:13:26,731
我跟我太太重修舊好了
My wife and I, we're back together.

354
00:13:26,731 --> 00:13:28,155
其實也還沒到完整如初
I-- Well, not exactly.

355
00:13:28,155 --> 00:13:29,729
但我們又重新開始約會
I mean, we're going on dates.

356
00:13:29,729 --> 00:13:30,862
-我們希望能重拾... -行行行
- We're hoping to recapture... - Yeah, yeah.

357
00:13:30,862 --> 00:13:32,106
我十分想聽你們的事情
I want to hear all about it,

358
00:13:32,106 --> 00:13:34,152
但本地的報社想找我拍照
but I think the local paper needs a photo.

359
00:13:34,152 --> 00:13:35,606
當然啦 沒問題
Oh. O-Of course. Yeah.

360
00:13:35,606 --> 00:13:37,270
歌洛莉亞 來合影
Gloria, get in the shot.

361
00:13:38,120 --> 00:13:38,520
歌洛莉亞
Gloria.

362
00:13:39,356 --> 00:13:42,074
但你答應過你會來的
But you promised that you were going to come.

363
00:13:42,074 --> 00:13:43,939
你就拍吧 沒事 直接拍[發射]吧
Just shoot. No, go ahead -- shoot it.

364
00:13:43,939 --> 00:13:45,253
什么 行吧
What? Okay.

365
00:13:45,553 --> 00:13:46,748
別別 還沒呢
No, no, not yet!

366
00:13:50,400 --> 00:13:51,980
靠 歌洛莉亞 剪不斷啊
Damn it, Gloria! It's not cutting!

367
00:13:52,360 --> 00:13:53,580
這不是左撇子用的剪刀
These aren't lefties!

368
00:13:55,722 --> 00:13:57,056
游行大禮官
Grand Marshal.

369
00:13:57,056 --> 00:13:58,590
認輸吧 爺爺
Take that, Grandpa!

370
00:13:58,590 --> 00:13:59,994
你肯定感覺自己是世界之王了
You must be on top of the world.

371
00:13:59,994 --> 00:14:01,307
我現在是故作鎮定
Well, I'm putting on a brave face

372
00:14:01,307 --> 00:14:02,922
為了不給國家添亂 但事實上呢
for the good of the country, but the truth is,

373
00:14:02,922 --> 00:14:04,837
我們這開頭并不順利
we did not get off to a great start.

374
00:14:04,837 --> 00:14:06,612
歌洛莉亞今天狀態不佳
Gloria is not on her game today,

375
00:14:06,612 --> 00:14:07,705
我很擔心她會忘記
and I'm afraid she's gonna forget

376
00:14:08,300 --> 00:14:10,240
自己得負責在我演講完帶領群眾起身鼓掌
to lead the standing ovation after my speech.

377
00:14:10,573 --> 00:14:12,318
其實呢 我想要委任于你
Hm. In fact, I'm tagging you in.

378
00:14:12,318 --> 00:14:14,234
當你聽到"追逐幸福"就是信號
Your cue is "Pursuit of happiness."

379
00:14:14,234 --> 00:14:16,219
如果演技夠好 吼一句"太棒了"也無妨
And if you could sell it, a "bravo" Would be nice.

380
00:14:16,219 --> 00:14:18,646
行了 我知道歌洛莉亞是出了什么問題
Okay. I-I know what's wrong with Gloria.

381
00:14:18,646 --> 00:14:20,722
今天是你的大日子 而她感覺被冷落了
This is a big day for you, and she's feeling left out.

382
00:14:20,722 --> 00:14:21,785
不 才不是這樣
No, that's not it.

383
00:14:21,785 --> 00:14:22,758
靠
Damn it.

384
00:14:22,838 --> 00:14:24,753
你要到明天才能到嗎
You're not getting here till tomorrow?

385
00:14:25,160 --> 00:14:27,780
你名字里的尼改成"妮"才對吧
How does your name even have the word "man" in it?

386
00:14:27,980 --> 00:14:28,980
我恍然大悟了[有怪響]
Something just clicked.

387
00:14:29,300 --> 00:14:30,260
-下巴有問題嗎 -不是
- Jaw trouble? - No!

388
00:14:30,620 --> 00:14:33,040
她是在煩曼尼的事 他來不了嘛
She was just on with Manny, who's not coming.

389
00:14:33,076 --> 00:14:36,115
歌洛莉亞跟曼尼不是有些國慶節傳統嗎
Don't Gloria and Manny have some Fourth of July tradition?

390
00:14:36,115 --> 00:14:37,308
經你這么一說
Come to think of it,

391
00:14:37,308 --> 00:14:39,534
他們會一起分食蘋果派 再一同看煙花
they share a slice of apple pie and watch the fireworks.

392
00:14:39,534 --> 00:14:41,851
從他出生那年就開始了這個傳統
They've been doing that every year since he was born!

393
00:14:41,851 --> 00:14:45,571
直到今年沒戲了 所以歌洛莉亞不開心
Until this year, which is why Gloria is upset.

394
00:14:45,571 --> 00:14:46,985
-中啦 -你說得對
- Yes! - You're right!

395
00:14:46,985 --> 00:14:48,590
我讓游行的肩帶沖昏了頭
Mm-hmm. I let the sash go to my head.

396
00:14:48,590 --> 00:14:49,713
我壓根就不該帶來
I never should have brought it!

397
00:14:49,713 --> 00:14:51,107
我能幫到你
Oh, I can help you out,

398
00:14:51,107 --> 00:14:53,122
但你可能得放棄掉演講的這件事了
but you're gonna have to give up on your little speech thing.

399
00:14:53,560 --> 00:14:55,220
孩子 你等等 你去哪弄來的煙花
Hey, kid. Whoa, whoa, whoa. Where'd you get the fireworks?

400
00:14:55,348 --> 00:14:56,100
你是條子嗎
You a cop?

401
00:14:56,100 --> 00:14:57,013
你開玩...
Oh, co--

402
00:14:57,320 --> 00:14:59,480
在超市停車場有個小攤
There's a stand in the grocery store parking lot.

403
00:14:59,740 --> 00:15:00,660
不過他要收工了
But he's closing up.

404
00:15:00,884 --> 00:15:02,579
你去買煙花跟蘋果派
You get the fireworks and the apple pie.

405
00:15:02,579 --> 00:15:03,983
我來負責搞定曼尼
I will take care of Manny.

406
00:15:04,400 --> 00:15:06,360
我回來啦 犀利姐王者歸來
I am back. I am really back!

407
00:15:06,380 --> 00:15:07,580
我的車被堵起來了
My car's blocked in.

408
00:15:07,580 --> 00:15:08,740
這么多車流人群 我到不了的
All this traffic, I'll never make it.

409
00:15:08,760 --> 00:15:10,180
看到沒 就在那里
Look at that -- right there.

410
00:15:10,711 --> 00:15:12,336
快看 我是施里納
Check out! I'm a Shriner.

411
00:15:12,336 --> 00:15:14,833
贊啊 聽我說 我想借用你的車子
Cool! Listen, I need to borrow your car.

412
00:15:14,833 --> 00:15:16,116
有很緊急的事情
It's kind of an emergency.

413
00:15:16,116 --> 00:15:18,192
但我爸爸很期待看到我出現在游行里呢
But my dad's excited to see me in the parade.

414
00:15:18,192 --> 00:15:19,606
他曾是個塔斯克基飛行員呢
He was a Tuskegee Airman.

415
00:15:19,606 --> 00:15:21,612
或許當你開始停止過度渴求他的愛時
Maybe the minute you stop trying so hard

416
00:15:21,612 --> 00:15:23,286
他才會真正開始愛你
is the minute he'll start loving you.

417
00:15:23,286 --> 00:15:25,312
現在快給我下車去為我在
Now hop out of there and go clear a path for me

418
00:15:25,312 --> 00:15:26,375
草地的椅子陣中開路
through those lawn chairs.

419
00:15:26,375 --> 00:15:27,849
-快點 我拉你一把 -但是我不...
- Come on. I'll help you out. - But...I don't --

420
00:15:29,845 --> 00:15:31,399
玩玩這個怎么樣
Oh, how about this one, okay?

421
00:15:31,720 --> 00:15:33,505
或許我們運氣好能選到他的強項
Maybe we'll get lucky and he'll be good at this.

422
00:15:33,505 --> 00:15:35,661
你不覺得這游戲太充滿憎恨嗎
Okay, don't you think this is a little hateful --

423
00:15:35,661 --> 00:15:37,767
-水刑一個小丑來得獎品 -少來了
- waterboarding a clown for a prize? - Oh, come on.

424
00:15:37,767 --> 00:15:39,652
你們整天互相用氣泡水噴對方
You guys spray each other with seltzer all the time.

425
00:15:39,652 --> 00:15:41,086
那是在彼此同意的小丑之間玩的游戲
That's between two consenting clowns.

426
00:15:41,086 --> 00:15:43,493
好啦 等我一下 準備開拍
All right, one second. Let's get this.

427
00:15:43,493 --> 00:15:45,328
好 你開始吧
Okay, go ahead. Okay.

428
00:15:45,328 --> 00:15:46,180
不 不對 反了 拿反了
No. No. Wrong way, wrong way.

429
00:15:46,180 --> 00:15:47,905
你得... 你得朝...
Oh, okay, all right, all right, You got to --

430
00:15:47,905 --> 00:15:49,359
-算了 沒事 -其實呢
- Okay, it's fine. - You know what?

431
00:15:49,680 --> 00:15:51,800
或許我們是時候跟小帕坦白
Maybe it's just time we admit to Pam

432
00:15:51,800 --> 00:15:53,020
我們什么都沒教會他
we haven't taught him a thing.

433
00:15:53,310 --> 00:15:55,717
其實我... 我只是不想對他做得不好
You know, I just -- I don't want to let him down.

434
00:15:55,717 --> 00:15:58,415
我開始習慣并喜歡有他的陪伴了
I-I've come to really enjoy having him around.

435
00:15:58,660 --> 00:16:00,100
我懂 我也是
I know, I know. Me too.

436
00:16:00,160 --> 00:16:01,560
但這并不是因為我們不會教孩子啊
But it's not like we're bad at parenting.

437
00:16:01,960 --> 00:16:04,520
你看莉莉就長成了一個聰明善解人意的姑娘
I mean, Lily turned out to be a smart, sensitive little girl.

438
00:16:05,043 --> 00:16:07,350
你太給我們這個家族丟臉了
Ugh! You're a disgrace to this family!

439
00:16:07,380 --> 00:16:09,420
你是不是沒聽清楚我說的 我開過橋了啊
I don't think you heard me. I'm over the bridge.

440
00:16:09,840 --> 00:16:11,200
我知道啊 我們只是在敘敘舊而已
I know. Now we're just catching up.

441
00:16:12,180 --> 00:16:13,680
對不起 我沒有贏
Sorry I didn't win.

442
00:16:13,828 --> 00:16:16,144
沒事沒事 你不用道歉 知道嗎
Oh, no, no, no. You don't have to apologize, okay?

443
00:16:16,144 --> 00:16:17,879
沒事的 你做得很棒了
No, no, you did just great.

444
00:16:18,020 --> 00:16:19,820
我們才是應該要做得更好的人
Oh! We're the ones who need to do better.

445
00:16:19,900 --> 00:16:21,860
而且其實啊 你很會抱抱呢
And you know what? You give great hugs.

446
00:16:21,900 --> 00:16:23,600
這是我們教會他的
Hey. We taught him that.

447
00:16:23,800 --> 00:16:25,980
可惜這算不上什么技能
Well, too bad it isn't exactly a skill.

448
00:16:26,920 --> 00:16:28,680
是嗎
Or is it?

449
00:16:29,540 --> 00:16:30,440
羊國英雄
Mutton busting?!

450
00:16:30,800 --> 00:16:31,840
什么 那是什么玩意
Why? What is that?

451
00:16:32,020 --> 00:16:34,340
是兒童版的騎羊大賽
It's a sheep rodeo for kids.

452
00:16:34,780 --> 00:16:36,400
感覺你壓根就沒有童年啊
It's like you didn't even have a childhood.

453
00:16:36,400 --> 00:16:37,400
來吧
Come on!

454
00:16:38,226 --> 00:16:40,994
熱狗大胃王比賽馬上要開始啦
The hot dog contest is about to begin.

455
00:16:41,120 --> 00:16:42,440
抱歉我的戰斗狀態不夠好
Sorry I'm not in worse shape for this.

456
00:16:42,760 --> 00:16:44,960
沒事的孩子 你心里很多煩心事嘛
Don't worry about it, buddy. You've had a lot on your mind.

457
00:16:45,260 --> 00:16:46,600
選課的事情有眉目了嗎
Any luck choosing your courses?

458
00:16:47,020 --> 00:16:47,800
還沒
Not yet.

459
00:16:48,120 --> 00:16:49,960
我現在不是很想談這件事
I don't really want to talk about that right now.

460
00:16:50,700 --> 00:16:52,160
或許是你過度給自己壓力...
Maybe you're putting too much pressure on --

461
00:16:52,160 --> 00:16:53,700
這不只是單純的選課好嗎
It's more than just picking classes, okay?

462
00:16:54,000 --> 00:16:56,120
能不談那件事 專心眼前的比賽嗎
Can we just drop it and focus on what we're doing here?

463
00:16:56,300 --> 00:16:58,240
當然啦 沒問題
Yeah. Of course.

464
00:17:02,000 --> 00:17:03,840
參加比賽很興奮吧
Exciting to be in the competition, huh?

465
00:17:03,840 --> 00:17:06,100
比過去三年在觀眾席旁觀強太多了
Instead of sitting up in the bleachers, like the last three years?

466
00:17:06,100 --> 00:17:07,060
應該是吧
I guess.

467
00:17:08,000 --> 00:17:09,680
令人恐慌 但那一種
Scary, sure, but it does feel good

468
00:17:09,680 --> 00:17:10,680
下場爭取勝利的感覺也很爽
putting our butts on the line.

469
00:17:11,178 --> 00:17:14,367
你輸掉沒參加的熱狗比賽的幾率是100%
You lose 100% of the hot-dog-eating contests you don't enter.

470
00:17:14,367 --> 00:17:16,443
爸 我知道你的汽車貼紙寫了什么
Dad, I know what your bumper sticker is,

471
00:17:16,443 --> 00:17:18,147
我也聽出了你話中有話的招數
and I know what you're trying to do here.

472
00:17:18,400 --> 00:17:19,360
但上大學不一樣啊
But college is different.

473
00:17:19,600 --> 00:17:22,000
當你連社區大學都沒讀好時 你就真走投無路了
I mean, you screw up at community college, you're out of options.

474
00:17:22,439 --> 00:17:23,864
你不會沒讀好的
You're not gonna screw it up.

475
00:17:23,954 --> 00:17:26,150
我這一生沒做好的事情太多了
I've messed up a lot of things in my life.

476
00:17:26,600 --> 00:17:27,640
我很害怕會又重蹈覆轍
I'm scared I'll do it again.

477
00:17:27,960 --> 00:17:29,580
-很好啊 -什么
- Good. - What?

478
00:17:29,840 --> 00:17:31,200
你在乎了才會害怕
Being scared means you care.

479
00:17:31,254 --> 00:17:34,252
或許... 或許你以前就是少了這份在乎的心
Maybe -- Maybe that's what's been missing in the past.

480
00:17:34,440 --> 00:17:36,460
這是我此生嘗試過最重大的事情了
It's the biggest thing I've ever tried to do.

481
00:17:36,659 --> 00:17:38,865
參賽者們 各就各位
Contestants, ready position.

482
00:17:38,865 --> 00:17:40,580
一步一步來
Just take it one step at a time.

483
00:17:40,600 --> 00:17:43,340
別擔心接下來要吃掉的50份
Don't worry about the 50 to hopefully 75 hot dogs

484
00:17:43,358 --> 00:17:44,442
或最好75份的熱狗
you're gonna eat.

485
00:17:44,451 --> 00:17:46,607
你就專注眼前的那一份就行了
Just worry about the dog in front of you.

486
00:17:47,540 --> 00:17:48,480
還有別忘了沾濕面包
And wet the buns.

487
00:17:49,160 --> 00:17:49,340
開吃
Eat!

488
00:17:51,760 --> 00:17:54,040
-你確定這個安全嗎 -天啊 那當然
- Are we sure this is safe? - Oh, my gosh, yes.

489
00:17:54,040 --> 00:17:55,560
這游戲小孩愛玩 羊也愛玩
The kids love it, the sheep love it.

490
00:17:56,340 --> 00:17:57,800
而且我挺確定反悔也來不及了
And I'm pretty sure it's too late.

491
00:17:57,939 --> 00:17:59,854
抱穩了 卡爾
Whoa! Hang on, Cal!

492
00:17:59,884 --> 00:18:01,048
抱住別撒手
Keep hugging!

493
00:18:01,428 --> 00:18:02,662
天啊 小帕看到一定超激動
Oh, my gosh. Pam is gonna be so excited.

494
00:18:02,662 --> 00:18:04,607
卡爾的抱羊技術已經達到一年級生水平
He's already busting at a first-grade level.

495
00:18:07,836 --> 00:18:10,484
最好去照個X光 你傷得挺重
Better get an X-ray. You got trampled pretty bad.

496
00:18:10,484 --> 00:18:12,459
感覺你腳踝骨折了
Looks like that ankle's broken.

497
00:18:13,780 --> 00:18:14,580
無不無聊啊 杰瑞
Really, Jerry?

498
00:18:16,520 --> 00:18:18,460
海莉 你來這里干嘛
Haley? What are you doing here?

499
00:18:18,620 --> 00:18:19,860
你發了推特說你在工作
Well, you tweeted you were working,

500
00:18:19,960 --> 00:18:21,855
你在照片應用上的分享能看到你背后的水塔
the water tower's in the back of your Instagram story,

501
00:18:21,855 --> 00:18:23,109
然后你還在點評應用上
and you just left a Yelp rating

502
00:18:23,109 --> 00:18:24,583
給角落的那家炸丸子留評價了
for that falafel place around the corner,

503
00:18:24,583 --> 00:18:25,656
所以我推理出你在哪里
so I figured out where you were.

504
00:18:25,656 --> 00:18:27,752
你能不能不要再對我癡心糾纏
Could you please stop being so obsessed with me?

505
00:18:27,752 --> 00:18:28,765
等... 你說什么
Wait -- what?

506
00:18:28,765 --> 00:18:30,600
你在醫院里說的那一番話
That thing that you said at the hospital?

507
00:18:30,600 --> 00:18:32,706
說如果覺得在一段感情中自己是賺到了
How if a person felt lucky to be in a relationship,

508
00:18:32,706 --> 00:18:34,471
那這個人永遠不會真正開心
that means that they couldn't really be happy?

509
00:18:34,580 --> 00:18:37,160
你說這番話很明顯是想毀了我跟阿爾文
Obviously, you did that to try and ruin what I have with Arvin,

510
00:18:37,160 --> 00:18:38,200
因為你還沒放下我
because you're not over me.

511
00:18:38,880 --> 00:18:40,860
我真的不知道我是該笑
I seriously don't know whether to laugh

512
00:18:40,860 --> 00:18:42,280
還是該檢查你是不是被蜘蛛咬了
or check you for a spider bite.

513
00:18:42,900 --> 00:18:44,980
你開始質疑自己的感情我很遺憾
I'm sorry that you're questioning your relationship,

514
00:18:45,000 --> 00:18:46,140
但這不是我的錯啊
but it's not my fault.

515
00:18:46,220 --> 00:18:47,720
你就老實承認吧
Just admit it!

516
00:18:47,840 --> 00:18:49,720
你說那些話就是想跟我重修舊好
You said that to try and get back with me.

517
00:18:50,220 --> 00:18:52,460
聽我說 在我內心的內心中
Look, in my heart of hearts --

518
00:18:52,600 --> 00:18:54,520
雖然那地方并不存在
which does not exist, by the way --

519
00:18:55,000 --> 00:18:56,800
是的 我還是有想著我們那段情
yeah, I still think about us.

520
00:18:56,940 --> 00:18:57,920
我們很合
We were great.

521
00:18:58,367 --> 00:19:00,082
-抓到了 -抓個屁
- Ah ha! - Not ha.

522
00:19:00,082 --> 00:19:01,476
你才是那個大老遠開車過來
You're the one who drove across town,

523
00:19:01,476 --> 00:19:03,191
還付了12塊停車費
paid $12 for parking

524
00:19:03,191 --> 00:19:06,099
然后再額外花了2塊買了黃腕帶
and then an additional $2 for the yellow wristband

525
00:19:06,099 --> 00:19:08,295
好得到啤酒與醫療照護服務
for beer and medical tent access.

526
00:19:08,295 --> 00:19:10,271
感覺你才是對我戀戀不忘的人吧
It sounds like you're the one who's into me.

527
00:19:10,520 --> 00:19:11,460
你神經病
You're crazy.

528
00:19:11,760 --> 00:19:13,360
想著如果我們沒分手會如何
There's no crime in wondering

529
00:19:13,360 --> 00:19:15,000
并沒有什么錯
if we might still be good together.

530
00:19:15,300 --> 00:19:18,260
在我內心的雙眼中我還能看到我們在一起
I still see us together in my mind's eye --

531
00:19:18,260 --> 00:19:20,540
-雖然那雙眼并不存在 -我不想再聽一次了
- which, by the way, doesn't exist. - I can't hear it again.

532
00:19:23,000 --> 00:19:24,080
診斷結果 沒感情
Diagnosis -- nothing.

533
00:19:33,500 --> 00:19:35,300
游行如何了
How was the parade?

534
00:19:35,540 --> 00:19:37,340
我有更重要的事情要做
I had something more important to do.

535
00:19:37,660 --> 00:19:38,180
蘋果派嗎
Apple pie?

536
00:19:38,710 --> 00:19:40,726
我在駕駛購買窗口時被人用異樣眼光看了
I got a few weird looks at the drive-through,

537
00:19:40,726 --> 00:19:44,707
但為了你們的節日傳統 那也值了
but it was worth it to help keep your tradition alive.

538
00:19:44,707 --> 00:19:46,231
你是指我與曼尼嗎
You mean Manny and me?

539
00:19:46,231 --> 00:19:47,575
這沒戲了 因為...
It's not gonna happen, because --

540
00:19:47,575 --> 00:19:49,160
這部分我也搞定了
I've got that covered, too.

541
00:19:52,489 --> 00:19:54,635
老媽 我很想你
Hi, Mom! I miss you!

542
00:19:54,635 --> 00:19:56,329
杰 這真是太完美了
Oh, Jay! That's perfect!

543
00:19:56,329 --> 00:19:57,694
還沒到完美呢
Oh, it's not perfect yet.

544
00:19:59,820 --> 00:20:01,560
我們把這么危險的工作交給
Should we really give the dangerous job

545
00:20:01,560 --> 00:20:03,700
我家唯一的聰明孩子合適嗎
to my only smart one?

546
00:20:09,416 --> 00:20:12,003
國慶節快樂 寶貝
Happy Fourth of July, Papi!

547
00:20:12,003 --> 00:20:14,249
我很快就會回家的 非常快
I'll be home soon -- before you know it.

548
00:20:14,350 --> 00:20:15,292
"托馬斯·杰斐遜
"Thomas Jefferson,

549
00:20:15,292 --> 00:20:17,488
他也算是他年代的游行大禮官之類的吧
who was sort of the grand marshal of his time,

550
00:20:17,488 --> 00:20:20,146
他相信這個國家應該是個讓人民
believed this country should be a place where people are free

551
00:20:20,146 --> 00:20:22,563
擁有自由追逐幸福與更好生活之地
to pursue happiness and a better life,

552
00:20:23,295 --> 00:20:25,942
也是個可以展望無限星空與未來
where we can set our sights on the stars

553
00:20:26,764 --> 00:20:29,151
而且只要努力并有決心
and, with hard work and determination...

554
00:20:29,853 --> 00:20:32,510
就能夠讓一切不可能成真的地方"
...make the impossible a reality.

555
00:20:32,510 --> 00:20:33,444
不是吧
No!

556
00:20:33,513 --> 00:20:36,080
因為美國人從不在挑戰面前退卻
Because Americans don't run from challenges.

557
00:20:36,080 --> 00:20:37,305
我們迎向挑戰
We embrace them.

558
00:20:39,020 --> 00:20:40,180
天佑美國
God bless America.

559
00:20:40,780 --> 00:20:41,840
然后等待掌聲"
Hold for applause."

560
00:20:43,581 --> 00:20:44,895
這一席話絕對會震撼全場吧
That would've killed, right?

561
00:20:45,276 --> 00:20:46,730
太棒了
Bravo!

562
00:20:46,730 --> 00:20:49,267
我今天放棄了許多東西 你就不能走點心嗎
You know, I gave up a lot today. You could mean it.

563
00:20:51,540 --> 00:20:53,960
為明年提前做訓練 再早都不嫌早
Never too early to start training for next year.

564
00:20:53,980 --> 00:20:55,886
先做點暖身運動放松肌肉
Let's loosen up first from some exercises.

565
00:20:55,886 --> 00:20:56,819
羊駝舔舌法
Lama lick.

566
00:20:57,179 --> 00:20:58,113
小號手迪吉·葛拉斯彼法
Dizzy Gillespie

567
00:20:58,613 --> 00:20:59,677
吐納法
Tiffy pop it.

568
00:21:00,600 --> 00:21:01,320
憋住
Hold it.

569
00:21:01,640 --> 00:21:02,300
吐出
And out.

570
00:21:02,500 --> 00:21:04,800
爸 我覺得我這輩子再也吃不進熱狗了
Dad, I don't think I can ever eat another hot dog again.

571
00:21:05,272 --> 00:21:07,047
我猜到了你可能會有這感覺
I thought you might feel this way.

572
00:21:08,260 --> 00:21:09,500
你在嗎
Hey, you there?

573
00:21:09,760 --> 00:21:10,240
干嘛啦
What?

574
00:21:10,306 --> 00:21:12,763
我們碰到了困難 吃不下這些熱狗
We are having some troubles getting these bad boys down.

575
00:21:12,763 --> 00:21:15,059
你們這兩廢柴我真是一點都不意外
I'm not surprised you pathetic losers.

576
00:21:15,059 --> 00:21:17,677
你們倆比那些熱狗更讓我感到惡心
You two disgust me more than most of these hot dogs.

577
00:21:17,677 --> 00:21:18,800
是哪里讓你們吃不下了
What's the hold up?

578
00:21:18,800 --> 00:21:22,510
你們倆姑娘想為比基尼季節減肥嗎
Are we saving or bodies for bikini season, ladies?

579
00:21:23,140 --> 00:21:25,200
-她好厲害 -最好夠厲害 她收費可高了
- She's good. - She better be. She's expensive.
